===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|film}} Filmed in a greater aspect ratio than the 1.33:1 or 1.37:1 aspect ratio.
# {{lb|en|of a [[motion picture]]}} Presented in the original aspect ratio; presented in [[letterbox]] [[orientation]].

